OL,4,CItem that prompted A&E evacuation was  
OL,5,Ce-bike charger                         
OL,6,GPart of an A&E department was          
OL,7,Gevacuated after concerns were raised   
OL,8,Gover a man carrying a "suspicious      
OL,9,Gitem" that was found to be an e-bike   
OL,10,Gcharger.                               
OL,12,FPolice said a man was spoken to at the 
OL,13,FLeicester Royal Infirmary at 17:36 GMT 
OL,14,Fon Sunday, following concern he was    
OL,15,Fcarrying a "suspicious device".        
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
