OL,4,CThree teens guilty of murdering man in 
OL,5,Cskate park                             
OL,6,GThree male teenagers have been found   
OL,7,Gguilty of murder after a fight with    
OL,8,Gmachetes left one man dead and another 
OL,9,Gseriously injured.                     
OL,11,FA six-week trial at Northampton Crown  
OL,12,FCourt heard that Mason Miller, 20,     
OL,13,Fdied after being stabbed in the chest  
OL,14,Fduring a fight at Briar Hill Skate     
OL,15,FPark in Ringway, Northampton, at about 
OL,16,F15:30 GMT on 18 February.              
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
