OL,4,CPolice make arrest in rape             
OL,5,Cinvestigation                          
OL,6,GPolice investigating the rape of a     
OL,7,Gwoman near a rail line in              
OL,8,GNottinghamshire have made an arrest.   
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Clay Lane,     
OL,11,FNewark, after the woman was attacked   
OL,12,Fat about 15:00 GMT on 18 November.     
OL,14,FNottinghamshire Police said a man was  
OL,15,Farrested on suspicion of rape on       
OL,16,FMonday and had been bailed with strict 
OL,17,Fconditions.                            
OL,19,FThe force added the woman was still    
OL,20,Fbeing supported by specially trained   
OL,21,Fofficers.                              
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
